      "content": "wait, hold on. \"akin to the unsettling sounds one might hear from a small, unseen creature moving around within the pipes\"?? \n\nare you kidding me?? i'm trying to write a serious, legal letter to a property management company in germany so they fix my heating. if i send them a letter saying it sounds like a \"small, unseen creature\" is living in my pipes, they're going to think i've lost my mind and they definitely won't send a technician. they'll just ignore me or call social services.\n\ncan you please rewrite this and remove that creepy, weird imagery? i need it to be strictly professional and technical. please just describe the noises as mechanical disturbances or evidence of a broken internal component. i need this to sound like a legitimate maintenance request, not some ghost story.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
